+## How to update your code to use associated constants
+Assuming the following structure definition:
+```rust
+bitflags! {
+  struct Something: u8 {
+     const FOO = 0b01,
+     const BAR = 0b10
+  }
+}
+```
+In 0.9 and older you could do:
+```rust
+let x = FOO.bits | BAR.bits;
+```
+Now you must use:
+```rust
+let x = Something::FOO.bits | Something::BAR.bits;
+```
