+//! Numeric traits for generic mathematics
+//!
+//! ## Compatibility
+//!
+//! The `num-traits` crate is tested for rustc 1.60 and greater.
+
+#![doc(html_root_url = "https://docs.rs/num-traits/0.2")]
+#![deny(unconditional_recursion)]
+#![no_std]
+
